const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"只有日行情，还能研究价差吗？",en:"What can daily prices reveal?"},body:{zh:"Corwin与Schultz研究在缺少逐笔报价时，能否用每日最高价与最低价估计买卖价差。这是用容易取得的数据构造代理量，而不是从日行情恢复真实订单簿。",en:"Corwin and Schultz ask whether daily highs and lows can estimate spreads when detailed quotes are unavailable. The aim is a low-frequency proxy, not reconstruction of an order book."}},{title:{zh:"实际输入不止最高与最低价",en:"Practical inputs extend beyond highs and lows"},body:{zh:"作者示例程序要求证券身份、日期、月份及拆股调整后的最高、最低和收盘价，成交量可用于识别无交易日。程序先处理无效区间，再调整隔夜收益，最后计算价差。因此，把未经检查的日高低价直接代入一个公式，并不等于使用了完整方法。",en:"The authors' sample program requires security identity, date, month and split-adjusted high, low and closing prices; volume can identify nontrading days. Invalid ranges and overnight returns are handled before estimation. Feeding unchecked daily extremes into a formula therefore does not reproduce the documented procedure."},reference:{url:"https://sites.nd.edu/scorwin/files/2019/08/Sample-SAS-Program-Description.pdf",label:{zh:"作者程序说明：输入与步骤1–2",en:"Author program description: inputs and steps 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"价格区间包含两种变化",en:"A range mixes two components"},body:{zh:"作者的思路是：最高与最低成交价之间的差异，既包含价格波动，也包含买卖价差。两种成分随观测区间扩展的方式不同，因而可以结合一天与两天的高低价比进行识别。",en:"High-low ranges combine price variation and spread effects. Their different behavior as the observation interval expands motivates combining one-day and two-day high-low ratios."}},{title:{zh:"估计价差与观测价差不同",en:"Estimated is not observed"},body:{zh:"论文比较低频价差估计与高频有效价差，作者配套材料还区分逐月横截面和逐股时间序列的比较。两类比较回答的问题不同；即使总体误差较小，单日、单股的估计仍不等于可成交成本，数量、冲击和费用也需另行考虑。",en:"The paper compares low-frequency estimates with high-frequency effective spreads. Its companion material separates monthly cross-sectional and stock-level time-series comparisons. Those answer different questions: aggregate accuracy does not make a daily estimate executable, and size, impact and fees remain separate."}},{title:{zh:"零值可能来自规则，而非无成本交易",en:"A zero can reflect a rule, not costless trading"},body:{zh:"配套程序把负的日价差估计设为零，并要求一个月至少有12个观测；附录还说明了部分缺失高低价的替代处理。编辑建议：保留原始值与每次调整标记，区分缺失、替代和截断后的零。这个专用估计规则不能推广成所有行情缺口的自动填补规则。",en:"The companion program floors negative daily estimates at zero and requires at least 12 observations per month; the appendix also describes replacement of some missing extremes. Editorial application: retain raw values and adjustment flags. Missing, substituted and floored-zero values differ, and this estimator-specific convention is not a general gap-filling rule."},reference:{url:"https://sites.nd.edu/scorwin/files/2019/11/Internet-Appendix_FINAL.pdf",label:{zh:"作者附录表IA.I说明与程序步骤3–4",en:"Author appendix Table IA.I notes; program steps 3–4"}}},{title:{zh:"与波动率论文一起读",en:"Read with volatility measurement"},body:{zh:"已实现波动率研究讨论高频收益如何聚合；这里则尝试从低频区间分离波动与价差。准备数据时先核对高低价口径、交易时段和停牌情况；具体计算还需结合原文公式、适用条件与异常处理。",en:"Realized volatility aggregates high-frequency returns; this paper separates components of low-frequency ranges. Check price conventions, sessions and suspensions. Consult the full specification and exception handling before implementing the estimator."}}],readerLimits:{zh:"高低价法是依赖清洗约定的价差代理。本导读结合作者配套说明，不复现主文推导；它不能替代真实报价、订单簿或成交成本。",en:"The proxy depends on cleaning conventions. This guide uses the authors' companion instructions, not a replication of the derivation; it does not replace quotes, an order book or execution costs."}};export{e as default};
